# Mobile iOS UI Rules

The mobile app is iOS-first using Expo React Native.

## Design direction

The app should feel like:
- Nice Price Bazar
- premium iOS shopping app
- warm local bazar brand
- practical and fast
- not generic
- not AI-generated

## Liquid Glass-inspired rules

Use glass only for:
- bottom tab bar
- search bars
- floating action bars
- map overlays
- checkout summary/action areas
- important headers

Do NOT use glass for:
- every product card
- long text content
- forms with many fields
- glass inside glass
- low contrast text

## Product cards

Product cards should be solid, readable, and fast.
They can use:
- cream/white surfaces
- red/yellow accent badges
- clean price display
- small shadow
- rounded corners

They should not be over-blurred.

## Navigation

- Floating tab bar must not cover content.
- Respect safe areas.
- Avoid buttons near the iPhone home indicator.
- Keep active tab clear.
- Admin users should not enter the mobile app.

## Forms

- Keyboard must not cover inputs.
- Inputs must have clear labels.
- Validation errors must be readable.
- Checkout must be simple.

## Accessibility

- Tap targets must be large enough.
- Important buttons need readable labels.
- Do not rely only on color.
- Keep contrast high on red/yellow backgrounds.
- Avoid excessive motion.

## Visual polish

Use subtle:
- haptics
- animation
- shadows
- rounded corners
- empty states
- loading states

Do not overanimate.